+## Till sales
+
+Schema 3 adds a sales row collection and sale ID sequence. Each row stores
+its ticket, UTC sale instant, dish ID, portion count, and scaled ingredient
+quantities at sale time. These quantities keep historical theoretical usage
+stable when recipes change. Sale movements carry the sale instant and the
+reference `sale:<ticket>`. Older files start with empty sales history.
